  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ── HERO ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">⚡ Open-source · MIT License · Salesforce Native</div>
  <h1>
    Stop Waiting for<br/>
    <span class="grad">Heavy LLMs.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    <strong>FlashAgent Stack</strong> resolves a $50,000 VIP crisis in <strong>400ms</strong> —
    not 15 seconds. System 1 reflex AI + WebMCP native UI control,
    deployable on Salesforce Sites, Cloudflare Workers, or your browser.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-btns">
    <a class="btn-primary" href="https://github.com/furuCRM-Inc/flash-agent-stack" target="_blank">⭐ Get Started Free</a>
    <a class="btn-outline" href="mailto:support@furucrm.com">Talk to Enterprise Support</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="hs"><span class="hs-num hs-num--c">10ms</span><div class="hs-lbl">Warm inference</div></div>
    <div class="hs"><span class="hs-num hs-num--a">$0</span><div class="hs-lbl">Infrastructure cost</div></div>
    <div class="hs"><span class="hs-num hs-num--g">0</span><div class="hs-lbl">Output tokens</div></div>
    <div class="hs"><span class="hs-num hs-num--p">MIT</span><div class="hs-lbl">License</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── INTERACTIVE TERMINAL DEMO ────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="demo-section" id="demo">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">Live Simulation</div>
  <h2 class="section-h2">Watch it resolve a $50,000 crisis in real time</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Three windows. One AI reflex. The support rep hasn't finished reading the message.</p>

  <div class="terminal-stage">

    <!-- Window 1: Incoming chat -->
    <div class="win" id="win1">
      <div class="win-bar">
        <span class="wd wd-r"></span><span class="wd wd-a"></span><span class="wd wd-g"></span>
        <span class="win-title">💬 Service Cloud · Live Chat</span>
      </div>
      <div class="win-body">
        <div class="chat-vip-label"><span class="vip-dot"></span>VIP Customer · Enterprise Tier</div>
        <div class="chat-bubble">
          <span id="chatText"></span><span class="cursor-blink" id="chatCursor">|</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-tag chat-hidden" id="chatTag">🔴 CRITICAL · $50,000 THREAT</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Window 2: JSON logits -->
    <div class="win" id="win2">
      <div class="win-bar">
        <span class="wd wd-r"></span><span class="wd wd-a"></span><span class="wd wd-g"></span>
        <span class="win-title">🧠 System 1 — Jev Reflex Engine</span>
      </div>
      <div class="win-body">
        <pre class="json-pre" id="jsonOutput" style="opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s"></pre>
        <div class="latency-tag" id="latencyTag">⚡ 50ms · 0 output tokens</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Window 3: Salesforce action -->
    <div class="win" id="win3">
      <div class="win-bar">
        <span class="wd wd-r"></span><span class="wd wd-a"></span><span class="wd wd-g"></span>
        <span class="win-title">🔧 WebMCP · Salesforce LWC</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-header">Case #VIP-001 · Enterprise</div>
      <div class="win-body">
        <div class="sf-case">
          <div class="sf-case-label">Customer</div>
          <div class="sf-case-value">Tanaka Corp (Enterprise)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sf-case">
          <div class="sf-case-label">Threat Value</div>
          <div class="sf-case-value" style="color:var(--rose);font-weight:700">$50,000 ACV at risk</div>
        </div>
        <button class="sf-btn sf-btn--default" id="sfBtn">💳 Approve Refund</button>
        <div class="resolved-badge" id="resolvedBadge">
          <span class="resolved-icon">✅</span>
          <div class="resolved-num">412ms</div>
          <div class="resolved-lbl">TOTAL PROCESS TIME</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:20px">
    <button class="btn-primary" id="demoRunBtn" onclick="runDemoAnim()">▶ Run Demo</button>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FEATURES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="features" id="features">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">Why This Changes Everything</div>
  <h2 class="section-h2">System 1 AI — the paradigm shift</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Traditional LLMs are System 2: slow, verbose, expensive. FlashAgent is System 1: pure reflex, no text generation, calibrated probabilities.</p>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feat-card">
      <span class="feat-icon">⚡</span>
      <h3>Zero-Token Latency</h3>
      <p>FlashAgent never generates text. It evaluates typed questions against a state object and returns numbers — probability, choice, score. No streaming. No hallucination.</p>
      <span class="feat-tag">0 output tokens</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-card">
      <span class="feat-icon">🔌</span>
      <h3>Native WebMCP Bridge</h3>
      <p>LWC components register themselves as AI-callable tools via <code style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px">document.modelContext.registerTool()</code>. No screenshot. No DOM scraping. Direct function calls.</p>
      <span class="feat-tag">document.modelContext</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-card">
      <span class="feat-icon">🎯</span>
      <h3>Three Question Types</h3>
      <p><strong>Noul</strong> — calibrated binary probability (0–1).<br/><strong>Choice</strong> — routing decision with confidence.<br/><strong>Score</strong> — weighted urgency across ordered levels.</p>
      <span class="feat-tag">Noul · Choice · Score</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-card">
      <span class="feat-icon">☁️</span>
      <h3>Deploy Anywhere Free</h3>
      <p>Cloudflare Workers free tier: 100,000 requests/day, zero cold starts. Vercel, Railway, Bun locally. Or run entirely in-browser with Transformers.js — zero infrastructure forever.</p>
      <span class="feat-tag">$0 infra cost</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-card">
      <span class="feat-icon">🏗️</span>
      <h3>Salesforce Sites Native</h3>
      <p>Full Visualforce + LWC deployment. Auto-detects: in-browser NLI → Apex callout → simulated fallback. Works on Experience Cloud, App Builder, and standalone Salesforce Sites.</p>
      <span class="feat-tag">sf project deploy start</span>
